<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτελ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.8
				</span></i>
			) <i>subject to taxes, tributary,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.111
			</span></i>; in full, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτελὴς φόρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				56
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.57
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. φόρων</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόροις </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόρου</span> Schaefer) <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Art.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; of persons employed in government monopolies (exact sense
			uncertain), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ὑποτελεῖς τῇ τε ἰχθυηρᾷ κτλ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>UPZ</u>
					110.97
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				5.210
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				40.24
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑποτελῆ γενήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PRev.Laws</u>
					28.18
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				33.14
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>receiving payment,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			.</div>
